error[SC0411]: `*pq` is read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ a_pointer_read_through_an_address_in_a_loop_before_the_body_writes_it_is_reported.c:7:9 ]
   │
 7 │         r = *pq;
   │         ───┬───  
   │            ╰───── read here
───╯
  = note: C17 6.2.4 p6 and 6.7.9 p10 leave a local indeterminate until something writes it, and Annex J.2 lists using that value as undefined
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = help: assign to it before reading it
